PGCF OpenEBS LVM exporter metadata and pool custody patch

This image contains OpenEBS LVM LocalPV 1.10.1, source commit
e8a234cbfeef5fa16fde1330c8de2d91e31831f1, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Original copyright notices are retained in the corresponding source archive.

PGCF contributors added exporter metadata readers/collectors and regression tests
on 2026-10-13. CSI device-path validation and thin-pool capacity discovery retain
the upstream implementation. The pool custody protocol adds a per-volume lock
and durable denial before filesystem/raw-block NodePublish and NodeExpand,
and before the node's volume/snapshot reconciliation writes. The denial persists
across agent death; only the qualified agent clears it after verified cleanup.
The upstream source archive and applied patch accompany this image under /usr/share/pgcf.

The rebuilt binary includes the Go runtime (BSD-3-Clause). Its license and
the vendored dependency notices are retained alongside this notice.
